{"id":431,"date":"2024-07-29T08:25:21","date_gmt":"2024-07-29T08:25:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?page_id=431"},"modified":"2026-01-23T12:51:17","modified_gmt":"2026-01-23T12:51:17","slug":"contact-us","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/contact-us\/","title":{"rendered":"Contact Us"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"431\" class=\"elementor elementor-431\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d8eb604 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d8eb604\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d25d06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1d25d06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We\u2019re here to help with any questions, concerns, or inquiries you may have. Whether you\u2019re interested in our custom electronics packaging solutions, need assistance with an order, or just want to learn more about what we do, our team is ready to assist you.<\/p><h4>How to Reach Us<\/h4><p><strong>Phone:<\/strong><br \/><a href=\"tel:+15033580443\"><span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\"><b>+1 (503) 358-0443<\/b><\/span><\/a><br \/>Call us during business hours to speak directly with a member of our team.<\/p><p><strong>Email:<\/strong><br \/><a rel=\"noopener\">info@shopcardboardboxes.com<\/a><br \/>Send us an email, and we\u2019ll get back to you as soon as possible.<\/p><p><strong>Address:<\/strong><br \/>1639 70th St,Brooklyn, New York, 11204 USA<br \/>Visit our office or mail us at the address above.<\/p><h4>Get in Touch<\/h4><p>Use the form below to send us a message. Whether you\u2019re requesting a quote, seeking support, or simply want more information, fill out the required fields, and we\u2019ll respond promptly.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8fb0ad9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8fb0ad9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-63c4324 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"63c4324\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\">\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"container\" data-elementor-id=\"2174\" class=\"elementor elementor-2174\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-652454b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"652454b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d7b314f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d7b314f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc4a86f elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cc4a86f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Let\u2019s work together<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ebe5b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8ebe5b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor